  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s2_sub_043_student_f_01",
      "hash64": "4B26BF5C7600182C",
      "text": "가라두구가지를 엮고 엮으면...\\n액세서리를 만들 수 있어!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s2_sub_043_student_f_02",
      "hash64": "4B26C25C76001D45",
      "text": "가라두구가지를 주면\\n가라두구팔찌나\\r\\n가라두구머리장식을 만들어 줄게!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_sub_043_select_01",
      "hash64": "DF5476E50DC8F73E",
      "text": "가라두구팔찌",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_sub_043_select_02",
      "hash64": "DF5475E50DC8F58B",
      "text": "가라두구머리장식",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_sub_043_select_03",
      "hash64": "DF5474E50DC8F3D8",
      "text": "그만둔다",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_sub_043_student_f_03",
      "hash64": "4B26C15C76001B92",
      "text": "지금은 필요 없나 보구나!\\n그럼, 또 보자!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_sub_043_student_f_04",
      "hash64": "4B26BC5C76001313",
      "text": "가라두구팔찌를 만들려면\\n가라두구가지 8개가 필요한데 괜찮니?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_sub_043_student_f_05",
      "hash64": "4B26BB5C76001160",
      "text": "가라두구머리장식을 만들려면\\n가라두구가지 15개가 필요한데 괜찮니?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_sub_043_student_f_06",
      "hash64": "4B26BE5C76001679",
      "text": "가라두구가지가 부족해!\\n코스트 에리어를 돌아다니면 주울 수 있어!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_sub_043_student_f_07",
      "hash64": "4B26BD5C760014C6",
      "text": "알았어! 맡겨만 줘!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_sub_043_student_f_08",
      "hash64": "4B26C85C76002777",
      "text": "얼기설기...\\n얼기설기...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s2_sub_043_student_f_09",
      "hash64": "4B26C75C760025C4",
      "text": "자, 여기 있어!\\n금방 만들었지?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s2_sub_043_student_f_10",
      "hash64": "4B233A5C75FD0056",
      "text": "가라르의 모습인\\n야돈에게 잘 어울릴 거야!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
